# Browser
# What the client shows of a total cost the cost changes in play make (CR 601.2f): under Bot1's Trinisphere, Force of Will's
# card menu offers its mana cost, {3}{U}{U}, which Trinisphere leaves as it is, and its alternative cost, whose row says it
# costs {3} now - three mana besides the life and the blue card, which its text does not say. Bot1 casts it that way in
# response to Bot2's Duress, from four blue floated: one is left. The untapped Island makes the mana cost payable too, so both
# casts are offered and the click opens the menu.

